\", \"ok what about Sorrento?\"], [\"I was telling a friend about the horse tack we saw on a walk, so do I have any pictures about bridle saved anywhere?\", \"Oh nice, that's the one I was thinking of. What about Valladolid, anything there?\", \"Great, and while I'm digging through old walks — what about Sorrento?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0039\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to get my head around the next few days because it all feels a bit crammed, so when is the Chetan thing happening?\", \"Hang on, quick one while I remember — I think I filed some paperwork a while back, do I have any documents about daimice?\", \"Okay, going back to the Chetan thing — I want to know how many people to expect, so who's coming along to it?\"], [\"Could you tell me when the Chetan event is, please?\", \"Sorry, a quick question before I forget — would you check whether I have any documents about daimice?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the Chetan event, could you tell me who is coming to it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0040\", \"v\": [[\"I'm putting together a little album of this year's trips and I can't remember where everything was, so which places were my photos taken at?\", \"Hang on, something else just popped into my head — I've got that Quentin business coming up, when is it again?\", \"Okay, back to the list of places — I want to start with the Valladolid one, so could you show me the photos from there?\"], [\"what places were my pics taken at\", \"wait quick one, when's the Quentin thing\", \"ok back to the places, show me the pics from the Valladolid one pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0041\", \"v\": [[\"messaged Esteban today, can u log that\", \"the dentist one\"], [\"I'm trying to keep better track of who I've been in touch with, so could you note that I messaged Esteban today?\", \"Oh sorry, I should've said — it was the one who's my dentist.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0042\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you log that I… I messaged Esteban Svoboda today?\"], [\"messaged Esteban Svoboda today, log it pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0043\", \"v\": [[\"I need to get in touch with Chetan about something from the weekend, so could you pull up Chetan for me?\", \"Hang on, before I forget — my accountant's been asking about it, where is my watercress invoice saved?\", \"Okay thanks. About the Hynmere one from before — I want to get a card sorted in time, so when is their birthday?\"], [\"pull up Chetan\", \"wait, watercress invoice where?\", \"Hynmere one's birthday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0044\", \"v\": [[\"who owes me money?\", \"total?\", \"went round to visit Sanjana, log it\", \"debts with them?\", \"never mind\"], [\"umm who… who owes me money at the moment?\", \"ok and how much is that, like, altogether?\", \"right, so I went round to visit Sanjana, can you, er, log that?\", \"and what about the… the debts with them, what's there?\", \"oh, actually, never mind, leave it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0045\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out if I can squeeze anything else in, so how many events have I actually got on friday?\", \"Totally different thing — I was showing someone the antler picture and couldn't remember, where did I take it?\", \"Also, I've got a trip coming up and want to make the most of it, so what else is happening while I'm in Cartomere?\"], [\"how many events friday?\", \"antler picture — where taken?\", \"what else on while in Cartomere?\"]]}","ttft_ms":8092,"type":"result","duration_ms":27803,"uuid":"1f938a8f-63e5-4a9d-96e4-bf3e4dec3fce","ttft_stream_ms":1277,"time_to_request_ms":171,"first_content_frame_ms":1277,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22432752,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278983351.7134,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
